				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1818586/operation-llewyn-dark#post-3722828</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Feb 2018 16:27:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Pyrocracy</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3723131</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This was very well put together, but something that pulled me out of the immersion was the name of the UK’s normalcy agency. I am assuming that you chose MI666 as a reference to the Secret Intelligence Service MI6 and the number of the Beast, but the United Kingdom’s Directorate of Millitary Intelligence only has departments up to MI19. (And MI666 sounds kind of cheesy) As a suggestion, MI13 is unused and using that as the name of the UKDIM’s normalcy agency could provide an in-universe reason they weren’t used IRL</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
