t.</p> <p>ETA: Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smapti" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=362048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1472980326" alt="Smapti" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=362048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/smapti" >Smapti</a></span> for reminding me that it was <span style="text-decoration: line-through;"><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kalinin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2203795&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1472980326" alt="Kalinin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2203795)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kalinin" >Kalinin</a></span></span> Kaliningrad not Koenigsburg at the time the treaty was signed.</p> 
